DESCRIPTION:European Conference on Genetic Programming\nMeeting: 2027-03-31
  to 2027-04-02\, Mainz\, Germany\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-30\
 nCutoff time unannounced: official deadline day only. Verify the organize
 r's submission portal.\nFormat: Paper-based / Springer LNCS\nOfficial sou
 rce: https://www.evostar.org/2027/important-dates/\nVenue Radar: https://
 gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#eurogp-2027\nNotes: Official EvoStar pages
  confirm Mainz\, March 31-April 2\, in hybrid mode. On 2026-10-30 the Imp
 ortant Dates page strikes November 1 and gives November 16\, 2026 (extend
 ed) for EvoStar paper submissions\, including EuroGP\; an older post embe
 dded on the EuroGP page still shows November 1. Published deadline days h
 ave no exact cutoff hour or timezone\; AoE timestamps are provisional and
  calendars use all-day events. A shared EvoStar late-breaking-abstract da
 te (March 21\, 2027) has no 2027 call page yet and is not tracked. S is a
 n editorial size estimate for EuroGP\, not the whole EvoStar event.
